Placing an order at a cafe

Write the story `coffee`: the `Customer` goes to the `Till` with the label
`order`, the `Till` sends to the `Barista` with the label `ticket`, and the
`Barista` gives to the `Customer` with the label `cup`.
---
story coffee {
  Customer -> Till: order
  Till -> Barista: ticket
  Barista -> Customer: cup
}
